`vUv` in [fragment.glsl](file:///home/gaitano/01-studio/01-src/shaders/monopo-vn/src/shader/fragment.glsl#L14) modify fail. GLSL forbid write to `varying` inside fragment shader; `varying` read-only. `st` compute at line 12 never use.

Create local `vec2` variable:

```glsl
void main() {
        vec2 uv = vUv * 2.0 - 1.0;

        gl_FragColor = vec4(uv, 0.0, 1.0);
}
```

